<title>POLAND: POLISH METALS FIRM IMPEXMETAL PRICES IPO PLN 36-41.</title>
<headline>POLISH METALS FIRM IMPEXMETAL PRICES IPO PLN 36-41.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Issuer:				   Impexmetal SA</p>
<p> Type of issue:			  common shares</p>
<p> Priced at (PLN):			36-41</p>
<p>IPO tranches:</p>
<p> No of shares offered:		 Subscription period</p>
<p> Large-investor	  2,657,643   April 21-23</p>
<p> Employees		   531,528   April 21-23</p>
<p> Sale of state shares: 2,976,560   April 21-30</p>
<p> No of Existing Shares:7,441,400</p>
<p>Use Of Proceeds: investment in firms in holding, upgrade computer system, 20 percent of proceeds for paying debts</p>
<p>NOTE: Book-building will help set minimum issue price. Final price of shares will be set by state treasury and be announced no later than two days before the issue's start.</p>
<p> Earnings Data (mln PLN)  1996		    1995</p>
<p> Net profit:		  20.7		    26.4</p>
<p> Pre-tax			49.0		    49.7</p>
<p> Sales:			 1.4 bln		 1.1 bln</p>
<p>The firm has said it sees 1996 group sales at $1.2 bln.</p>
<p>The state treasury currently holds all the firm's shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
